    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "source": "How to use open d1 decision models",
      "spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "source": "Reach for d1 decision models when you need fast, structured decisions, including multimodal inputs. d1-3B delivers the highest decision quality at its size, while d1-omni-600M fits where footprint matters.",
      "spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "source": "Install the dependencies (requires transformers>=5.14):",
      "spans": [
        {
          "start": 35,
          "end": 53,
          "kind": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "source": "These model ship their own code, so load it with trust_remote_code=True:",
      "spans": [
        {
          "start": 49,
          "end": 71,
          "kind": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "source": "For brevity, we only include the example for d1-3B. See the d1-omni-600M model card for instructions on how to run it.",
      "spans": [
        {
          "start": 60,
          "end": 83,
          "kind": "a",
          "href": "https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/d1-omni-600M"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "source": "Get Started with open d1 decision models",
      "spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "source": "Both decision models are open-weight and available on Hugging Face today:",
      "spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "source": "Download: d1-3B and d1-omni-600M on Hugging Face.",
